  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO mental health Albania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WHO mentalv&#xE5;rd albanien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WHO har med Sida st&#xF6;d sedan 1999 arbetat med en mentalh&#xE4;lsoreform i Albanien. Nu beviljas de st&#xF6;d i ytterligare tv&#xE5; avslutande &#xE5;r f&#xF6;r samma m&#xE5;l - att decentralisera och humanisera mentalh&#xE4;lsov&#xE5;rden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO has since 1999 worked in Albania together with the Ministry of Health to reform the mental health systems. They have applied for support two years, june 2004 - june 2006, to continue the work to decentrilize and humanize the mental health services.</narrative>
  </description>
